Your system should have:

Historical Backtest
       ↓
Walk Forward
       ↓
Out-of-Sample
       ↓
Monte Carlo
       ↓
Paper Trading
       ↓
Small Live Capital
       ↓
Full Deployment

And model:

Brokerage
Taxes/charges where relevant
Slippage
Spread
Partial fills
Liquidity
Latency
Contract expiry
Corporate actions where applicable
Market hours

Otherwise a beautiful backtest can be meaningless.
